      "description": "Feed card for a health-level recall: solid red verdict band, 3px red frame, red tint ground, photo beside the product name.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-sticker ds-h\" href=\"#\"><div class=\"ds-band ds-bh\"><svg class=\"ds-ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7.86 2h8.28L22 7.86v8.28L16.14 22H7.86L2 16.14V7.86Z\"/><path d=\"M12 8v4M12 16h.01\"/></svg><span>Helbredsfare</span></div><div class=\"ds-body\"><div class=\"ds-top\"><div><p class=\"ds-name\">Eksempel pølser</p><p class=\"ds-facts\">500 g · 12.12.2026</p></div><div class=\"ds-photo\"></div></div><p class=\"ds-action\"><svg class=\"ds-ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg>Smid den ud eller aflever den</p><div class=\"ds-meta\"><span><svg class=\"ds-ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"/></svg>Netto</span><time>27.11.2026</time></div></div></a>",
